  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="9f4c9ab8-847e-57da-bac9-72ad677bf2fd" activityNameId="7b298391-cdee-5c98-a8a1-a2d2810d36d3" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Grain maize organic, at farm</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Grain maize organic, at farm
Inventory refers to the production of 1 kg grain maize organic, at farm with a moisture content of 14%. Fresh matter yield/ha at 14% moisture is 7777kg.;
Synonyms: corn, Zea mays L.; 
UUID: afa1d2e1-60c2-3a5a-9c67-548c75f86611
The inventory includes the processes of soil cultivation, sowing, weed control, fertilisation, pest and pathogen control, harvest and drying of the grains. Machine infrastructure and a shed for machine sheltering is included. Inputs of fertilisers, pesticides and seed as well as their transports to the regional processing center (10km) are considered. The direct emissions on the field are also included.
Location: Refers to an average production in the Swiss lowlands.
Technology: Organic production
Time period: The yield data have been collected for the years 1996-2003.
Production volume: CH prod of grain maize: 180900t in 2004.
Sampling: Data were compiled from statistics, pilot network, fertilising recommendations, documents from extension services, information provided by retailers and expert knowledge. The production data were verified and adjusted by a group of experts. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_afa1d2e1-60c2-3a5a-9c67-548c75f86611.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
